-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATA NOTICE (not part of the MIT grant above)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* The Kaggle dataset `zhuosun03/bilibili-must-watch` is labelled with an
  UNKNOWN license on Kaggle. No original CSV, zip, or bulk copy is distributed
  with this repository. `SW_download.py` re-fetches it from Kaggle's public
  download endpoint; downstream users must verify their own right to use it.
* Comment texts collected from public Bilibili endpoints are user-generated
  content. Raw comment files and the row-level analysis table are excluded by
  `.gitignore` and are NOT distributed here. Only aggregate results are kept.
* No usernames, user IDs, avatars, signatures, or other identity fields are
  stored by the collector. See `docs/SW_data-source.md` for the full boundary.
